"file_name": "FP_7_Memory.png", "id": "1665972815197170", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673573223_1665972818530503_2441172749659531655_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PQBmP8zvNQcQ7kNvwGUIUez&_nc_oc=AdpRxG7_EIhvKWwN0rX9RXWMsM90yAIAs9bpPOpZP7_jNdjcctOAHPlHQ8zVXXFmmao&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU7BYP2CKt7B5UNvEaGO9fYuDhiy3WU31DlAFVVe4TyaQ&oe=6B103909"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "PLUCK-trailer-thumbnail-2560x1440.png", "id": "1123415017218676", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827567_1123415020552009_884159746102987162_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ca62ZdpAOooQ7kNvwE_zNSC&_nc_oc=AdrVvBT_ousQmTY596KMlpRaSZUhjmtsyuW_ekgI-BRFkJ-tHf946GkYpt-6Qf1TKiQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXVsW_zCsknfMpdJdc933hDTm6fxyJLmzFimMsIgRbrDg&oe=6B1064C0"}, "display_name": "Pluck", "keywords": ["puzzle", "Building", "adventure", "Arcade", "retro"], "long_description": "## Can you program your brain to tell jokes?\n\n**The answer is YES!** You just need a genius to build the machine.\n\nThe Doctor is brilliant, proud and very tall. He calls himself *the King of Jokes*. It's been years since he made anyone laugh. So he built a mechanical brain made of puzzles. Each puzzle you solve connects a piece of joke logic. Connect enough of them, and the brain tells a joke.\n\nAll it needs is someone to play it. That's you.\n\n### Play the machine\nCatch falling pieces, rotate them in your hands and place them on a 3D grid. Then use what you built: climb your own stairs, cross your own bridges, stand on top of your own towers. Every puzzle you solve wakes another part of the brain and builds the next joke. Early jokes are terrible. They get better. Slowly.\n\n### Every level, a new idea\n- Race rising lava to the top of a platform\n- Find pieces in the dark with your hands as the only light\n- Rebuild a structure from memory after it disappears\n- Steer a snake through a cube of space\n- Break a wall by batting a ball back with the piece in your hand\n- Sort shapes, push crates, sweep for mines, outplay the machine at four in a row\n- Guide a marble down a track you build on a tilting board\n- Climb a tower before something with eight legs catches you\n\n### Two ways to play\n- **Noob** \u2014 more time, more lives, slower dangers, and a guide that shows where each piece will land.\n- **Regular** \u2014 every level as designed, plus extra twists: cracking blocks, toppling pieces, shif", "short_description": "Can you program your brain to tell jokes? The answer is YES! You just need a genius to build the machine. A mechanical brain made of puzzles. Solve them, connect the joke logic, and make people laugh."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/pluckprivacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "zursona", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/pluckprivacypolicy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1376235555577250"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2538747456655288"}